<title>UK: JIB '96 pretax profit up 29 pct, as forecast.</title>
<headline>JIB '96 pretax profit up 29 pct, as forecast.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		13.5		   vs 10.1</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.0		    vs 5.0</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 8.5		    vs 7.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     27.5		   vs 21.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   198.4		  vs 179.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Prior to its merger with Lloyd Thomson Group plc, completed last month, insurance services company JIB Group plc had forecast that its preliminary profit before tax would not fall below 27 million stg.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44-171 542 7717</p>
</text>
